{"page":233,"verses":[{"verse_key":"11:98","surah":11,"ayah":98,"ar_uthmani":"يَقْدُمُ قَوْمَهُۥ يَوْمَ ٱلْقِيَـٰمَةِ فَأَوْرَدَهُمُ ٱلنَّارَ ۖ وَبِئْسَ ٱلْوِرْدُ ٱلْمَوْرُودُ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"He will be at the forefront of his people on the Day of Resurrection, leading them down towards the Fire. What a foul drinking place to be led to!","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"يَقْدُمُ","en_gloss":"He will precede","transliteration":"yaqdumu","verse_key":"11:98"},{"pos":2,"ar":"قَوْمَهُۥ","en_gloss":"his people","transliteration":"qawmahu","verse_key":"11:98"},{"pos":3,"ar":"يَوْمَ","en_gloss":"(on the) Day","transliteration":"yawma","verse_key":"11:98"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلْقِيَـٰمَةِ","en_gloss":"(of) the Resurrection","transliteration":"l-qiyāmati","verse_key":"11:98"},{"pos":5,"ar":"فَأَوْرَدَهُمُ","en_gloss":"and lead them","transliteration":"fa-awradahumu","verse_key":"11:98"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱلنَّارَ ۖ","en_gloss":"(into) the Fire","transliteration":"l-nāra","verse_key":"11:98"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَبِئْسَ","en_gloss":"And wretched","transliteration":"wabi'sa","verse_key":"11:98"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ٱلْوِرْدُ","en_gloss":"(is) the place","transliteration":"l-wir'du","verse_key":"11:98"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱلْمَوْرُودُ","en_gloss":"to which (they are) led","transliteration":"l-mawrūdu","verse_key":"11:98"},{"pos":10,"ar":"٩٨","en_gloss":"(98)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"11:98"}]},{"verse_key":"11:99","surah":11,"ayah":99,"ar_uthmani":"وَأُتْبِعُوا۟ فِى هَـٰذِهِۦ لَعْنَةً وَيَوْمَ ٱلْقِيَـٰمَةِ ۚ بِئْسَ ٱلرِّفْدُ ٱلْمَرْفُودُ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"They were pursued by God’s rejection in this life and will be on the Day of Resurrection, too. What a foul gift to be given!","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَأُتْبِعُوا۟","en_gloss":"And they were followed","transliteration":"wa-ut'biʿū","verse_key":"11:99"},{"pos":2,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"11:99"},{"pos":3,"ar":"هَـٰذِهِۦ","en_gloss":"this","transliteration":"hādhihi","verse_key":"11:99"},{"pos":4,"ar":"لَعْنَةًۭ","en_gloss":"(by) a curse","transliteration":"laʿnatan","verse_key":"11:99"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَيَوْمَ","en_gloss":"and (on the) Day","transliteration":"wayawma","verse_key":"11:99"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱلْقِيَـٰمَةِ ۚ","en_gloss":"(of) the Resurrection","transliteration":"l-qiyāmati","verse_key":"11:99"},{"pos":7,"ar":"بِئْسَ","en_gloss":"Wretched","transliteration":"bi'sa","verse_key":"11:99"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ٱلرِّفْدُ","en_gloss":"(is) the gift","transliteration":"l-rif'du","verse_key":"11:99"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱلْمَرْفُودُ","en_gloss":"which (will) be given","transliteration":"l-marfūdu","verse_key":"11:99"},{"pos":10,"ar":"٩٩","en_gloss":"(99)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"11:99"}]},{"verse_key":"11:100","surah":11,"ayah":100,"ar_uthmani":"ذَٰلِكَ مِنْ أَنۢبَآءِ ٱلْقُرَىٰ نَقُصُّهُۥ عَلَيْكَ ۖ مِنْهَا قَآئِمٌ وَحَصِيدٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"We relate to you [Muhammad] such accounts of earlier towns: some of them are still standing; some have been mown down;","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"ذَٰلِكَ","en_gloss":"That","transliteration":"dhālika","verse_key":"11:100"},{"pos":2,"ar":"مِنْ","en_gloss":"(is) from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"11:100"},{"pos":3,"ar":"أَنۢبَآءِ","en_gloss":"(the) news","transliteration":"anbāi","verse_key":"11:100"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلْقُرَىٰ","en_gloss":"(of) the cities","transliteration":"l-qurā","verse_key":"11:100"},{"pos":5,"ar":"نَقُصُّهُۥ","en_gloss":"(which) We relate","transliteration":"naquṣṣuhu","verse_key":"11:100"},{"pos":6,"ar":"عَلَيْكَ ۖ","en_gloss":"to you","transliteration":"ʿalayka","verse_key":"11:100"},{"pos":7,"ar":"مِنْهَا","en_gloss":"of them","transliteration":"min'hā","verse_key":"11:100"},{"pos":8,"ar":"قَآئِمٌۭ","en_gloss":"some are standing","transliteration":"qāimun","verse_key":"11:100"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَحَصِيدٌۭ","en_gloss":"and (some) mown","transliteration":"waḥaṣīdun","verse_key":"11:100"},{"pos":10,"ar":"١٠٠","en_gloss":"(100)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"11:100"}]},{"verse_key":"11:101","surah":11,"ayah":101,"ar_uthmani":"وَمَا ظَلَمْنَـٰهُمْ وَلَـٰكِن ظَلَمُوٓا۟ أَنفُسَهُمْ ۖ فَمَآ أَغْنَتْ عَنْهُمْ ءَالِهَتُهُمُ ٱلَّتِى يَدْعُونَ مِن دُونِ ٱللَّهِ مِن شَىْءٍ لَّمَّا جَآءَ أَمْرُ رَبِّكَ ۖ وَمَا زَادُوهُمْ غَيْرَ تَتْبِيبٍ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"We did not wrong them; they wronged themselves. Their gods, which they called on beside God, were no use to them when what your Lord had ordained came about; they only increased their ruin.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَمَا","en_gloss":"And not","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"11:101"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ظَلَمْنَـٰهُمْ","en_gloss":"We wronged them","transliteration":"ẓalamnāhum","verse_key":"11:101"},{"pos":3,"ar":"وَلَـٰكِن","en_gloss":"but","transliteration":"walākin","verse_key":"11:101"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ظَلَمُوٓا۟","en_gloss":"they wronged","transliteration":"ẓalamū","verse_key":"11:101"},{"pos":5,"ar":"أَنفُسَهُمْ ۖ","en_gloss":"themselves","transliteration":"anfusahum","verse_key":"11:101"},{"pos":6,"ar":"فَمَآ","en_gloss":"So not","transliteration":"famā","verse_key":"11:101"},{"pos":7,"ar":"أَغْنَتْ","en_gloss":"availed","transliteration":"aghnat","verse_key":"11:101"},{"pos":8,"ar":"عَنْهُمْ","en_gloss":"them","transliteration":"ʿanhum","verse_key":"11:101"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ءَالِهَتُهُمُ","en_gloss":"their gods","transliteration":"ālihatuhumu","verse_key":"11:101"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ٱلَّتِى","en_gloss":"which","transliteration":"allatī","verse_key":"11:101"},{"pos":11,"ar":"يَدْعُونَ","en_gloss":"they invoked","transliteration":"yadʿūna","verse_key":"11:101"},{"pos":12,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"other than Allah","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"11:101"},{"pos":13,"ar":"دُونِ","en_gloss":"other than Allah","transliteration":"dūni","verse_key":"11:101"},{"pos":14,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"other than Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"11:101"},{"pos":15,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"any","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"11:101"},{"pos":16,"ar":"شَىْءٍۢ","en_g